[{"client_msg_id":"9549cc08-9ec5-4259-a08d-61f91df3daaf","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"treesitter (nvim-treesitter) は対応されてるパーサーなどをそのまま使うなら良い感じですが、それ以外は結局 C でパーサーを書ける力とモチベがないと楽しくなさそうだし。例えばnvim-treesitter用のコメントアウト系の追加プラグインとかも、既存で使ってるプラグインを捨てて lua 製の諸々に入れ替えたりしないとうまく動かないものもあったりするので。深堀りするとモチベがないと色々長引きそうな感想...","ts":"1624621887.131000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dbR"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01QD3YAUMP","text":"\u003c@U01QD3YAUMP\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624600397.130100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2487619a-e435-4677-967c-696db4219055","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"nvim-ts-rainbow のデフォルトを無効にしたいけどそういう設定はなさそう。enable = false にしたら nvim-ts-rainbow 自体読み込まないような感じになっちゃう。とりあえず BufNewFile,BufRead で無効コマンド叩くように autocmd したけど。うーん。\n\n```augroup DisableRainbowAsDefault\n autocmd!\n au BufNewFile,BufRead * :TSBufDisable rainbow\naugroup END```","ts":"1624596951.129800","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1624596961.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cPb3"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"\u003c@U025UTETFDJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624596643.129500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fc882df8-775e-4b5a-99cb-56c773a63072","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"nvim-ts-rainbow のプラグイン自体で vue 用のscmファイル(htmlのコピってリネームして)を追加してみたらレインボーされた。少しずつ理解してきた \u003chttps://github.com/p00f/nvim-ts-rainbow/tree/master/queries\u003e","ts":"1624594677.129300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T7g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"221179c8-89c5-4e64-a8bb-f30eede540ac","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"nvim-ts-rainbow は vue はまだ対応されてないのか...。むーん。","ts":"1624594114.128600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lhw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6982d4c4-bccd-43fd-9404-b2253108045f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"treesitter さんでハイライトを有効にすると vim, neovim のそういったプラグインは無力になる(動かなくなる)という認識なのですがこれは認識あってますかね","ts":"1624594025.128400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TvOo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ff382ec-2fc1-4d25-bb2c-d992b1604fac","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応これ使ってます\n\u003chttps://github.com/luochen1990/rainbow\u003e","ts":"1624593809.127800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"luochen1990/rainbow","id":1,"title":"luochen1990/rainbow","text":"Rainbow Parentheses Improved, shorter code, no level limit, smooth and fast, powerful configuration.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"1390","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X511"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ee8924e-e5a8-4336-b769-c3913fc85074","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"やはりそうなのですね...。","ts":"1624593756.127600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qjF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62147986-dc22-42f0-8c4d-b50052083267","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"メンテちゃんとされてるのない気がしてます・・・","ts":"1624593610.126500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O/qb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb16990b-bfe3-43c8-9c07-9fa32be137f7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vim, neovim のrainbowのプラグインでメンテされてるやつってありますか？","ts":"1624593584.126200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZ+="}]},{"client_msg_id":"88000110-003c-421c-afc4-f79861cd61bc","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"lisp 書くのに rainbow あったら便利ですよね","ts":"1624593530.126000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mXWa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0eedeb5-22c1-4366-ba85-f207f27122e3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ハイライトとかもトグルできるのでもうお腹いっぱいです。","ts":"1624592987.125600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wi73u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c910ce90-26be-489c-a42e-74dae834174d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ちゃんと treesitter のドキュメントやコマンドをみてみたらシュッとできました。便利だー。\n\n`:TSBufToggle rainbow`","ts":"1624592920.125300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vRKvk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"082d8d0c-4272-4ec3-8f85-b19d3f216384","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"enableを書き換えてsetup叩き直すとかですかね？","ts":"1624591958.124200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pHG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01GH1TRL7N","text":"\u003c@U01GH1TRL7N\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624591412.123800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f6a8cffb-46d0-4c48-95b2-fb801cd19770","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"レインボーの設定をトグルできたらお腹いっぱいなのですが。やり方わからないっす。","ts":"1624590957.123500","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1624590972.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QX/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326f0aab-50f2-433d-aa89-6e902a5e8f19","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは treesitter で レインボーの使いたいのですが。\u003chttps://github.com/p00f/nvim-ts-rainbow\u003e","ts":"1624590930.122700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"p00f/nvim-ts-rainbow","id":1,"title":"p00f/nvim-ts-rainbow","text":":rainbow: Rainbow parentheses for neovim using tree-sitter :rainbow:","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"210","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3IF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac4d81ba-f2f6-4d3e-a4d1-64401e530ad2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"HTML+Mustache割とよくあるしあってもよさそう","ts":"1624590890.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SOGV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0008f0a5-29f2-40aa-b40a-f4dda76616b1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それはたしかに","ts":"1624590874.122100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FtQru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae76b5b9-ec51-4b9c-bcc2-b1c351196b9c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ただ、やはりこういう対応をすると大事なマスタッシュ構文的なのが逆にハイライトされなくなるので。専用の作らないと駄目なのかもしれませんね。","ts":"1624590841.122000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aQC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32c13244-d69b-4d23-a6b3-b9ed6a8178cc","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"used_by で試してみたらシュッとできました。ありがとうございます！\n\n**例**:\n\n```local parser_config = require \"nvim-treesitter.parsers\".get_parser_configs()\nparser_config.html.used_by = \"blade\"\nparser_config.html.used_by = \"htmldjango\"```","ts":"1624590787.121700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HYf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e1f2932-21d4-4795-a094-bcd344b6aa13","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほど。何かパーサー自体を書かないとみたいな話なのかと思って斜めよみしてたのですが、あとでちょっと試してみます。","ts":"1624590386.121500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e2WtK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e24cc507-dba5-4068-91ff-5f7a97a5ccf6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"zimbuを生やすのではなく既存の設定のused_byを足す感じで","ts":"1624590277.120900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aF6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"554d71ed-04cb-4217-a3b8-4c484085b51f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"試したわけじゃないけど、このへんの設定流用したらいけないのかな \u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter#adding-parsers|https://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter#adding-parsers\u003e","ts":"1624590249.120700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter","id":1,"title":"nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter","text":"Nvim Treesitter configurations and abstraction layer","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"1701","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Scheme","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QxoP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b90870b-406f-442a-8846-17b0270880f6","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"treesitter (nvim-treesitter) 使っている方にお聞きしたいのですが、サポートされていないファイルタイプで、すでにサポートされているファイルタイプに紐付けて有効にするようなことってできますか？例えば html ライクなテンプレート言語系のファイルタイプで、 html のハイライトを使うみたいなイメージです","ts":"1624589852.120600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q2xfc"}]}]
